What is Ecommerce ERP Software?
Ecommerce ERP (Enterprise Resource Planning) software represents a specialized category of business management systems designed specifically for online retailers. These platforms integrate essential operational functions including order processing, inventory management, supply chain coordination, financial reporting, and customer relationship management into a unified digital environment. Modern solutions feature advanced capabilities such as real-time inventory synchronization across multiple sales channels, automated order routing, and AI-powered demand forecasting.

